## Miami Beach's Ocean Drive & Collins Avenue Architectural District (5th–15th St).
## Every key is a verified `way:<id>` building in `miami_beach_detailed.osmb`.
## Consumed by `DecoFront` (via `FacadeRelief`) to add 3D cantilevered eyebrows,
## flutedbay pilasters, stepped/ziggurat/curved parapets, neon blade sign pylons,
## nautical portholes, and Ocean Drive sidewalk café awnings & umbrellas.

